# Terminology

On first use in a chapter, keep the English term and add Chinese in parentheses. Match the full dictionary in README.md (技术术语对照).

- Agent → 智能体 (Agent)
- Agentic System → 智能体系统 (Agentic System)
- Autonomous Agent → 自主智能体 (Autonomous Agent)
- Predictive AI → 预测性 AI (Predictive AI)
- Model → 模型 (Model)
- Tools → 工具 (Tools)
- Orchestration → 编排 (Orchestration)
- LLM → 大语言模型 (LLM)
- Reasoning → 推理 (Reasoning)
- Planning → 规划 (Planning)
- Memory → 记忆 (Memory)
- Reflection → 反思 (Reflection)
- Tool Use → 工具使用 (Tool Use)
